<title>ITALY: Italy retail sales rose 7.4 pct in Oct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italy retail sales rose 7.4 pct in Oct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales of medium and large firms in Italy rose 7.4 percent in October 1996 compared with a year earlier, national statistics institute ISTAT said.</p>
<p>It said the retail sales index (1990=100) was 151.2 in October.</p>
<p>Retail sales in the first 10 months of last year rose 5.5 percent compared with the same 1995 period and the index was 135.2.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
